 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Two patterns in -ire",
   "texto": [
    "In the verbs in **-ire** there are two models:",
    "1. **Modelo simple** (such as **partire**, **dormire**): **-o, -i, -e, -iamo, -ite, -ono** (**parto, parti, parte, partiamo, partite, partono**) disinences.",
    "2. **Modelo con infijo -isc-** (such as **finire**, **capire**): adds **-isc-** between the root and desinence in the three people of the singular and the third of the plural (**finisco, finisci, finisce, finiscono**). In **noi** and **voi** it is never added -is- (**finiamo, finite**)."
   ]
  },
